ynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出门叹二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"黄金萧索减仲产，玉龙不死酬君恩。\n朝来结客青楼饮，拍马齐出春明门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出门叹二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"昨朝易米菱花镜，今日换酒芙蓉钗。\n何忍颦眉对妻子，扬扬高步长安街。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道傍曲二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"磊砢嵚巇路不平，少年场里莫相倾。\n肝肠在舌人皆听，尽是清商激楚声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道傍曲二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"长路关山感慨深，愁霖毒雾昼阴阴。\n莲花匣里明秋水，照见含沙射影心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中行二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"吴儿越艳总垂髫，漫学青楼绾髻高。\n婉媚尽能歌宛转，不知谁是郑樱桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中行二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"城西柳市酒家奴，笑问鹴裘典尽无。\n怪杀文君春有恙，桃花临牖代当垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春台望","author":"张元凯","text":"百尺高台起凤凰，郊原草木尽文章。\n东皇幻出千端绮，散作中天紫翠光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜泊","author":"张元凯","text":"枫岸斜连荻苇洲，棹歌声起乱眠鸥。\n楚天夜静人无寐，万里长江片月流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客行二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"花月经行太主园，身曾仕汉不乘轩。\n装赍悉与爰丝饮，肝胆唯同剧孟言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侠客行二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"紫丝步障奏云璈，白玉深杯夜月高。\n一宿千金三妇艳，九衢驷马五陵豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆昔篇二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"忆昔君行烹伏雌，封侯消息昨朝知。\n虽然骤得金貂贵，可念牛衣对泣时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆昔篇二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"忆昔君行折柳条，一为京兆路迢遥。\n眉痕自顾真狼藉，临镜何曾着意描。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客晏居四咏 其一 芳树","author":"张元凯","text":"夭桃秾李碧城隈，黄鸟声中淑景催。\n春日载阳花正好，偏宜锦瑟与金罍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客晏居四咏 其二 冰壶","author":"张元凯","text":"销暑珠光映玉壶，层冰高插赤珊瑚。\n广寒宫里人难到，河朔沉酣梦入无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客晏居四咏 其三 明月","author":"张元凯","text":"三五清晖散碧空，郁葱嘉树露华中。\n不堪青岁徒零落，且就芳樽隐桂丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客晏居四咏 其四 瑞雪","author":"张元凯","text":"朱扉霰集转飘扬，白雪难侵白玉觞。\n人寿未能跻百岁，年丰聊与醉千场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客贫居四诗 其一 漏屋","author":"张元凯","text":"草色床头细雨沾，漫移长剑挂虚檐。\n中宵一隙生云雾，陋室翻疑有豹潜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客贫居四诗 其二 绝粮","author":"张元凯","text":"羞与侏儒共一囊，尚留灵草散金光。\n子房岂是雠俱报，闭户先寻辟谷方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客贫居四诗 其三 谢客","author":"张元凯","text":"室有蓬蒿釜有萍，雀罗正好施空庭。\n祁连幕下如云客，几个任安念卫青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和客贫居四诗 其四 无衣","author":"张元凯","text":"凤甲鹴裘易几缗，且将沽酒醉芳辰。\n生平未到秦庭哭，漫赋无衣不为贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思曲二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"江上行歌桃李秾，风柔花暖气融融。\n绣帏一入春无限，朝暮巫山云雨中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思曲二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"黄鸟间关最有情，大堤行处落花轻。\n亦知春色临邛好，绿绮携将出锦城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题二首 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"能歌善舞性多才，风曳轻绡素腕开。\n婉媚却从朱邸入，此儿疑是卖珠来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题二首 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"清扬白晰绿云髫，柳市兰闺意总消。\n最是春眠浑不醒，主人衫袖短萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其一","author":"张元凯","text":"肃将上帝祀明堂，宝鼎昭回日月光。\n九献不须歌旧曲，词臣昨已撰芝房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其二","author":"张元凯","text":"秋殿清斋正受釐，迎和门外立诸姬。\n大官不进麒麟脯，御馔唯供五色芝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其三","author":"张元凯","text":"陈词瘗玉奏钧天，西苑宫墙近籍田。\n水旱恐烦祠后土，未央深处好祈年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其四","author":"张元凯","text":"宫女如花满道场，时闻杂佩响琳琅。\n玉龙蟠钏擎仙表，金凤钩鞋踏斗罡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其五","author":"张元凯","text":"凤阁传呼鱼钥开，中官赍捧御题来。\n直庐夜照青藜火，银笔如椽彻晓裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其六","author":"张元凯","text":"方岳分符百道飞，四时禋类万灵归。\n休徵勒石盈青壁，瑞应成图进紫微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其七","author":"张元凯","text":"一株沉水万金装，篆刻蛟龙缕凤凰。\n工巧敢言歆上帝，精诚唯许格君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其八","author":"张元凯","text":"夕烽千里照甘泉，一纸降魔敕已传。\n急遣六丁乘羽驾，火轮金甲净幽燕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其九","author":"张元凯","text":"灵药金壶百和珍，仙家玉液字长春。\n朱衣擎出高玄殿，先赐分宜白发臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十","author":"张元凯","text":"宝箓金签灿几筵，子云正是草玄年。\n石渠天禄如林士，同校宣和道藏编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十一","author":"张元凯","text":"千云裘拥五雷冠，祈雪霄开太乙坛。\n符鹤未回金阙静，烛龙犹照玉宸寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十二","author":"张元凯","text":"金壶漏水响丁丁，直宿宫娥坐月明。\n潜听象床龙睡稳，玉阶低演步虚声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十三","author":"张元凯","text":"通天台上接三台，景命重临清醮开。\n拜舞不同郊社礼，科仪一一圣人裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十四","author":"张元凯","text":"香台紫气蔼晴空，灵贶神休集圣躬。\n垂拱万年如一日，礼臣何必议青宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十五","author":"张元凯","text":"内宫新制玉清符，独赐亲臣道允孚。\n何事官家频顾问，宰公冠上戴曾无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十六","author":"张元凯","text":"真人方术鬼神愁，出入金銮驾玉虬。\n济北少翁曾赐爵，胶东栾大已封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑宫词二十四首有序 其十七","author":"张元凯","text":"金符宝笈护云英，鸾鹤衔将入上清。\n拜受玉霄龙凤简，元阳象一字分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]